e referendums will be held but  either either or whatever the answer  might be to that particular question be  in no doubt the change a positive change  exciting change progressive change is  underway in ireland that's good news for  all of us and this island it's good news  also for britain and because  part of the whole project of building a  new island is building renewing  consolidating that relationship that we  have with our nearest neighbor  okay uh thank you very much for coming  on the program uh this morning very  strong views are given from yourself of  course and thank you very much

